{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>長沙灣有人暈倒。昨晚（19日）8時許，一名49歲鄭姓男子在海麗邨海賢樓住所暈倒，其兒子見狀報案。救護員接報到場，事主昏迷被送往明愛醫院接受搶救。</p><p>據了解，事主有身體病紀錄。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200241021686910976845023.jpeg/Dn32JP5-YRFPubdTYtRhXgxBWCjltDVGCpg6oQqYOqE\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.178393+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:18:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:37.116852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:34:04.103729+00:00","content_hash":"5923e65ce08733a76ba89a43a7d5ae4e12efb4e5bbb93d994cd3e22b386d281a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}